          "Object storage model, not a general block disk or shared POSIX filesystem."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "EBS-shaped",
        "capabilities": [
          "block_device"
        ],
        "caveats": [
          "Block volume model. Attachment and availability constraints require actual service design."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "EFS-shaped",
        "capabilities": [
          "shared_files",
          "nfs"
        ],
        "caveats": [
